        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIVE INTO THE CoThrust ADVENTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the smallest mistake can send you crashing down. CoThrust is a physics-based cooperative game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a crash, you find yourself as an astronaut on an unknown planet. Play solo or with a friend.<br>The only way to escape this mysterious planet is to use the thrusters and reach the rescue ship. Will you make it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/279d2726f5826a19b796b509b425423f.poster.avif?t=1763146144\" width=1152 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/279d2726f5826a19b796b509b425423f.webm?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/279d2726f5826a19b796b509b425423f.mp4?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COOPERATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only half of the control is in your hands. You must communicate, trust, and coordinate perfectly with your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/491291cc955160de4a79b8c280a8c0db.poster.avif?t=1763146144\" width=1152 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/491291cc955160de4a79b8c280a8c0db.webm?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/491291cc955160de4a79b8c280a8c0db.mp4?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In space there is no margin for error. To reach the SHIP, you must climb dangerous and challenging paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/f4b842f1ea70da57ac11afa2131295fc.poster.avif?t=1763146144\" width=1152 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/f4b842f1ea70da57ac11afa2131295fc.webm?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/f4b842f1ea70da57ac11afa2131295fc.mp4?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE CAREFUL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can’t use the thrusters forever. Each boost heats them up; once overheated, they cannot be used until they cool down. Plan every maneuver carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/5530c186df39312f95f183e536f3e325.poster.avif?t=1763146144\" width=1152 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/5530c186df39312f95f183e536f3e325.webm?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/5530c186df39312f95f183e536f3e325.mp4?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOW YOUR STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 19 different character models and express your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/8aca0da4418990c720c7e3f87bc10552.poster.avif?t=1763146144\" width=1152 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/8aca0da4418990c720c7e3f87bc10552.webm?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/8aca0da4418990c720c7e3f87bc10552.mp4?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 GAME MODES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy: A more forgiving experience with checkpoints and retries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard: No checkpoints, no turning back, pure challenge</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based, chaotic, and satisfying thruster controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo or co-op gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging climbs, environmental hazards, and timing-based sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thruster overheating mechanic that limits usage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character selection and customization options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOMBS</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>DIVE INTO THE CoThrust ADVENTURE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even the smallest mistake can send you crashing down. CoThrust is a physics-based cooperative game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After a crash, you find yourself as an astronaut on an unknown planet. Play solo or with a friend.<br>The only way to escape this mysterious planet is to use the thrusters and reach the rescue ship. Will you make it?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/279d2726f5826a19b796b509b425423f.poster.avif?t=1763146144\" width=1152 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/279d2726f5826a19b796b509b425423f.webm?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/279d2726f5826a19b796b509b425423f.mp4?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>COOPERATE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only half of the control is in your hands. You must communicate, trust, and coordinate perfectly with your partner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/491291cc955160de4a79b8c280a8c0db.poster.avif?t=1763146144\" width=1152 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/491291cc955160de4a79b8c280a8c0db.webm?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/491291cc955160de4a79b8c280a8c0db.mp4?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CLIMB</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In space there is no margin for error. To reach the SHIP, you must climb dangerous and challenging paths.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/f4b842f1ea70da57ac11afa2131295fc.poster.avif?t=1763146144\" width=1152 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/f4b842f1ea70da57ac11afa2131295fc.webm?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/f4b842f1ea70da57ac11afa2131295fc.mp4?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>BE CAREFUL</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can’t use the thrusters forever. Each boost heats them up; once overheated, they cannot be used until they cool down. Plan every maneuver carefully.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/5530c186df39312f95f183e536f3e325.poster.avif?t=1763146144\" width=1152 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/5530c186df39312f95f183e536f3e325.webm?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/5530c186df39312f95f183e536f3e325.mp4?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>SHOW YOUR STYLE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from 19 different character models and express your own style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/8aca0da4418990c720c7e3f87bc10552.poster.avif?t=1763146144\" width=1152 height=282 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/8aca0da4418990c720c7e3f87bc10552.webm?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4027680/extras/8aca0da4418990c720c7e3f87bc10552.mp4?t=1763146144\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2 GAME MODES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Easy: A more forgiving experience with checkpoints and retries</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hard: No checkpoints, no turning back, pure challenge</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Physics-based, chaotic, and satisfying thruster controls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Solo or co-op gameplay</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenging climbs, environmental hazards, and timing-based sections</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thruster overheating mechanic that limits usage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character selection and customization options</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >BOMBS</p></li></ul>",
